SysWOW64/wscript.exe
SysWOW64/vbscript.dll
SysWOW64/jscript.dll
SysWOW64/scrrun.dll
SysWOW64/wshom.ocx
# Proxy/stubs for IServiceProvider and the other ActiveX interfaces: a 32-bit COM
