# Crash reporter: kernel32 starts %SystemRoot%\System32\drwtsn32.exe for an unhandled exception, which a
# 32-bit program resolves to SysWOW64. Without it every crash of a 32-bit program shows the classic error
# box and never ends on a desktop nobody watches.
SysWOW64/drwtsn32.exe

